 <h1>D Kurd 9 handpan chords</h1>
 <p style="margin-top:8px">Kurd is natural minor over the ding. Start with the <b>i</b>, <b>iv</b> and <b>v</b>: play each card's lit notes, then move to the next. The app has 49 chord cards for this scale. New to handpan? Read <a href="/handpan-101/">Handpan 101: how to play a handpan</a> first.</p>
